    "@es": "Los números",
    "@en": "The numbers"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "Del 1 al 12 hay que aprenderlos de memoria. Del 13 al 19 acaban en **-teen**: thirteen, fourteen, fifteen…",
     "@en": "From 1 to 12 you have to learn them by memory. From 13 to 19 they end up in **-teen**: thirteen, fourteen, fifteen"
    },
    {
     "@es": "En los números de teléfono, las cifras se dicen una a una. Para el cero inicial se puede decir **zero** o **oh** (como la letra O).",
     "@en": "In the phone numbers, the figures are said one by one. For the initial zero you can say **zero** or **oh** (as the letter O)."
    }
   ]
